      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better formatting and descriptive test case names.The improved test compiled successfully. The key understandability improvements made were: each `Arguments.of(...)` entry is on its own line with an inline comment explaining its significance (ordinary date, boundary values, and out-of-range cases), a Javadoc comment on the provider method explains the Unix time 32-bit constraint, and the test body extracts `epochSeconds` into a named variable to make the data flow explicit."
    }
